This repository builds headless WebAssembly document engines for Ubu Office (Ubunex).
The format engines themselves are third-party open-source code, kept as git submodules under
upstream/ (unmodified, except for the one deckcraft patch noted below), each with its own
LICENSE, NOTICE and ATTRIBUTION files:

- upstream/pdfcraft — Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0. Fork of https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft.
- upstream/craft-libs — Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and contributors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0. Fork of https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs.
- upstream/wordcraft — Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the WordCraft contributors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0. Fork of https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft (the DOCX engine, docx/).
- upstream/gridcraft — Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the GridCraft contributors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0. Fork of https://github.com/storytold/gridcraft (the spreadsheet engine,
  xlsx/).
- upstream/deckcraft — Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the DeckCraft contributors.
  MIT OR Apache-2.0. Fork of https://github.com/storytold/deckcraft (the presentation engine,
  pptx/). Not unmodified: it carries one patch of ours, a default-on `media` feature on
  crates/engine (branch ubu/media-optional), which the presentation engine turns off.

